{"componentChunkName":"component---src-templates-blog-post-js","path":"/015-wood-cookies/","result":{"data":{"site":{"siteMetadata":{"title":"Wood Times"}},"markdownRemark":{"id":"95fdd01a-4733-5df0-a61d-4f769e7aefc1","excerpt":"When my parents oak tree came down at their old house, I saw an opportunity. Cross-sections of a tree - “wood cookies” - make beautiful display pieces, showing…","html":"<p>When my parents oak tree came down at their old house, I saw an opportunity. Cross-sections of a tree - “wood cookies” - make beautiful display pieces, showing off the growth rings and natural character that you’d never see in dimensional lumber.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/ff78cc0af6c12c2735491b1b9eb11227/669cd/stump.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Stump\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/ff78cc0af6c12c2735491b1b9eb11227/f058b/stump.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/ff78cc0af6c12c2735491b1b9eb11227/c26ae/stump.png 158w,\n/static/ff78cc0af6c12c2735491b1b9eb11227/6bdcf/stump.png 315w,\n/static/ff78cc0af6c12c2735491b1b9eb11227/f058b/stump.png 630w,\n/static/ff78cc0af6c12c2735491b1b9eb11227/40601/stump.png 945w,\n/static/ff78cc0af6c12c2735491b1b9eb11227/78612/stump.png 1260w,\n/static/ff78cc0af6c12c2735491b1b9eb11227/669cd/stump.png 3024w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>The stump told the story of a mature tree, decades of growth visible in those concentric rings. A few thick slices were cut with a chainsaw before the rest was hauled away.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/84bdb87043ddb4df0ddc2bd5b0083d1e/669cd/rough_cookie.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Rough Cookie\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/84bdb87043ddb4df0ddc2bd5b0083d1e/f058b/rough_cookie.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/84bdb87043ddb4df0ddc2bd5b0083d1e/c26ae/rough_cookie.png 158w,\n/static/84bdb87043ddb4df0ddc2bd5b0083d1e/6bdcf/rough_cookie.png 315w,\n/static/84bdb87043ddb4df0ddc2bd5b0083d1e/f058b/rough_cookie.png 630w,\n/static/84bdb87043ddb4df0ddc2bd5b0083d1e/40601/rough_cookie.png 945w,\n/static/84bdb87043ddb4df0ddc2bd5b0083d1e/78612/rough_cookie.png 1260w,\n/static/84bdb87043ddb4df0ddc2bd5b0083d1e/669cd/rough_cookie.png 3024w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Back in the shop, the raw slices were impressive but rough. Chainsaw marks, uneven thickness, and bark still attached. These would need some serious work to become usable.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/dc3143cb7550ce2ba4fc17a14408ea29/493ac/pair.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 75.31645569620254%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Pair\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/dc3143cb7550ce2ba4fc17a14408ea29/f058b/pair.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/dc3143cb7550ce2ba4fc17a14408ea29/c26ae/pair.png 158w,\n/static/dc3143cb7550ce2ba4fc17a14408ea29/6bdcf/pair.png 315w,\n/static/dc3143cb7550ce2ba4fc17a14408ea29/f058b/pair.png 630w,\n/static/dc3143cb7550ce2ba4fc17a14408ea29/40601/pair.png 945w,\n/static/dc3143cb7550ce2ba4fc17a14408ea29/78612/pair.png 1260w,\n/static/dc3143cb7550ce2ba4fc17a14408ea29/493ac/pair.png 4032w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Two cookies of similar size would make a matched pair. The grain patterns were unique to each slice, captured at slightly different heights along the trunk.</p>\n<p><span\n      class=\"gatsby-resp-image-wrapper\"\n      style=\"position: relative; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; max-width: 630px; \"\n    >\n      <a\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-link\"\n    href=\"/static/aa4953d503343ef26b0dd81cf0186c6e/669cd/flattening.png\"\n    style=\"display: block\"\n    target=\"_blank\"\n    rel=\"noopener\"\n  >\n    <span\n    class=\"gatsby-resp-image-background-image\"\n    style=\"padding-bottom: 133.54430379746836%; position: relative; bottom: 0; left: 0; background-image: url('data:image/png;base64,'); background-size: cover; display: block;\"\n  ></span>\n  <img\n        class=\"gatsby-resp-image-image\"\n        alt=\"Flattening\"\n        title=\"\"\n        src=\"/static/aa4953d503343ef26b0dd81cf0186c6e/f058b/flattening.png\"\n        srcset=\"/static/aa4953d503343ef26b0dd81cf0186c6e/c26ae/flattening.png 158w,\n/static/aa4953d503343ef26b0dd81cf0186c6e/6bdcf/flattening.png 315w,\n/static/aa4953d503343ef26b0dd81cf0186c6e/f058b/flattening.png 630w,\n/static/aa4953d503343ef26b0dd81cf0186c6e/40601/flattening.png 945w,\n/static/aa4953d503343ef26b0dd81cf0186c6e/78612/flattening.png 1260w,\n/static/aa4953d503343ef26b0dd81cf0186c6e/669cd/flattening.png 3024w\"\n        sizes=\"(max-width: 630px) 100vw, 630px\"\n        style=\"width:100%;height:100%;margin:0;vertical-align:middle;position:absolute;top:0;left:0;\"\n        loading=\"lazy\"\n        decoding=\"async\"\n      />\n  </a>\n    </span></p>\n<p>Flattening cookies this size required a lot of work, a power planer, hand planer, and a ton of sanding.</p>\n<p>These cookies would eventually become side tables, but that’s a project for another day. For now, they needed time to stabilize and dry properly. Rushing would only lead to cracks.s</p>","frontmatter":{"title":"Wood Cookies","date":"November 03, 2018","description":null}},"previous":{"fields":{"slug":"/014-spooky-ghost/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Spooky Ghost"}},"next":{"fields":{"slug":"/016-flight-cart/"},"frontmatter":{"title":"Flight Cart"}}},"pageContext":{"id":"95fdd01a-4733-5df0-a61d-4f769e7aefc1","previousPostId":"710d4f6c-0476-5660-8ad0-8cde26452047","nextPostId":"267919cf-43be-517c-b594-d9165c9c635f"}},"staticQueryHashes":["2841359383"],"slicesMap":{}}